    "vitamin solution still unexpanded (source inaccessible)",
    "glycine betaine, choline-O-sulfate and glucose as alternative carbon sources"
   ],
   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "MAMS base salts and SL-10 trace metals are now fully recovered and verbatim-sourced; SL-10 adds nickel and boron that were absent before. Oxygen corrected from 'facultative' to 'aerobic' (R. pomeroyi DSS-3 grown aerobically on choline/GBT). The only unresolved item is the Chen (2012) vitamin solution: its constituent vitamins could not be recovered because Chen 2012 (Wiley) and the upstream Thompson 1995 (ASM) Methods are paywalled/403; it is therefore listed by name and left UNEXPANDED rather than fabricated. Trace-metal molarities computed for a 1:1000 dilution of SL-10 (1 ml stock per L)."
  },
